// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_HUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1833717525" "Steady now... Let the prey come to us."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_HUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P288967791" "Aye, I hear it too... The howl of the vale... We shall hunt soon."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_HUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4195658715" "No, my brothers... allow the prey come to us."

// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3122677116" "Strange creatures... they do not run when the predator emerges."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3135850895" "Prey that doesn't run... does not fear...<em>Killing you will bring no joy."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P115345130" "Fearless... good...<em>Perhaps you are worthy prey."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1256558793" "I see... you seek to hunt the hunter... good."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2241039114" "Not much sport when the prey gives itself freely to the hunter."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2027892961" "Restless spirits... They will rest soon enough."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3562978204" "Misguided souls they are... fearless all the same."

// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P722064804" "The hunt is on!"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2302076493" "An enemy approaches..."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1673311845" "Unleash you fury, brothers!"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4105066728" "The flesh will be tearing this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3557006401" "The prey emerges!"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3486679914" "Come, brothers... The hunt continues!"

// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2979638596" "Die proud, little fawn... you gave a good chase this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4244563076" "Never have I hunted such a ferocious spirit!<em>Your trophy will hang proudly from my tree."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FEED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2295100913" "A good hunt... one to be sung of for many moons"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FEED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1740115136" "We have done well this night..."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FEED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3835635925" "Yes, my brothers... I enjoyed it too."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FEED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2110290545" "With the night comes its children... and this one was worthier than most."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2208706512" "Unfit as they are to be felled by my arrows... I will rid them of this land all the same."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P880991543" "Leave this land, soldier... you are not welcome in this land."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3745674886" "Getting colder as of late... prey has grown scarce."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P118173177" "The night is long... and the prey, abundant."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3661995399" "As long as the night holds sway over this land... we will hunt."




// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_TRACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1878458686" "...Looks like several creatures have been through here recently..."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_TRACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2569231469" "Tracks... several of them... we may yet hunt this night."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_TRACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4199061134" "These tracks... fresh, yet cold... what manner of creature is this...?"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_TRACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4154750587" "The winds are against us this night, brothers... the trail's gone cold."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3538062214" "Prey that doesn't run... does not fear...<em>Killing it will bring no joy."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4047082049" "Why don't you run... like the others, little spirit?"
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2039330227" "This one fears nothing... yet... I am unfulfilled in its capture."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2014098276" "His metal mask... I will carry with me to the hinterlands."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2364274806" "He lost heart... and so I found him."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2552413532" "He died without passion... without fervor... only duty kept him alive."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3453101858" "His metal mask... heavy and strong...<em>Symbolic of the man it failed to protect."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1224119753" "Once you strip a man of all his flesh... you see that beneath it all... he's just another animal... killing to survive."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3937729935" "You are a brave one... I will give you that.<em>...but the hunt ends here."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1066429332" "Slow... but strong...<em>...worthy enough for a kill."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_SURROUND_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4033037103" "Your heart beats with fire... it shall not go to waste."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2316809957" "Black talons... a good symbol... a strong symbol."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2055237249" "Her talons... cold and black...<em>...they will adorn my totem well."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1219878897" "As fearless as she was in battle... she is flesh and blood."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P582819502" "Her trophy will put all others to shame... this was a good night."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P571813688" "A good hunt... A worthy hunt..."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2493669339" "I will look fondly upon this kill for many moons..."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_LOOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2409014152" "She fought with such will... fell with such grace... how I long for more."


// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3709820536" "Huntresses... cruel and cunning...<em>...they can barely contain their own fury."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2026076933" "They are the embodiment of fury... with a fire in their eyes like none I have ever seen."
// NIGHTWARD_NIGHTSTALKERS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2355911270" "Their unbridled fury... it drives my heart to beating!"


